<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | My Ashburn Dentist" noIndex={true}><section class="legal"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Legal</p><h1 class="section-title">Privacy policy</h1><div class="prose"><p>We use information you submit through this website to respond to appointment requests and provide requested services. We take reasonable steps to protect submitted information.</p><p>Website analytics and call-tracking tools may collect usage information, referral data, and interactions to help us understand site performance and respond to patient inquiries.</p><p>You may contact the practice to ask questions about information submitted through this website. Please do not send sensitive medical or financial information through a general website form.</p></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.legal { padding: 5rem 0; }.legal .prose { margin-top: 2rem; }</style>
